  "observations": [
    "Both official front photographs show a substantially lower southwest appendage adjoining the long south facade.",
    "Visible low openings, raised entrance/platform level and upper rooms support a three-band vertical interpretation, not a surveyed count of full floors. The decorative high roof area is not counted as another occupied floor.",
    "Original footprint has a southwest C appendage. Extend original edge 1 westward through vertex 2 to edge 6 as the first estimated main/annex division; ground footprint is unchanged."
  ],
